 +
 +def  |
 | 2026-06-06 07:05 UTC | THESIS-A PART-(b) KILL-GATE, IMPORT-FIXED: on a CO | FAIL | Codex CLI error: Hard wall-clock cap after 4800s. Last output: emains stable. |
